@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade DevOps - Real GitHub Actions CI Pipeline

start
:Developer pushes to main\nor opens pull_request to main;
:GitHub Actions starts\n"Java CI with Maven";
:Runner ubuntu-latest;
:actions/checkout@v4;
:actions/setup-java@v4\njava-version 23\ndistribution oracle\ncache maven;
:Working directory\nEZTrade/backend;
:Runs mvn -B clean verify;
if (Maven verify succeeds?) then (yes)
  :CI status green;
else (no)
  :CI status failed;
endif
stop

note right
Evidence: ../.github/workflows/maven.yml.
The workflow compiles and tests the backend only.
There is Docker configuration for local development,
but no CI Docker build, image publication, deployment job,
or frontend build/lint/test step declared.
end note

@enduml
